      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Necrotic Decay",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "void"
      ],
      "text": "When an urdefhan dies, its invisible flesh quickly rots away and sublimates into a foul-smelling gas that fills a 5-foot emanation around the body.\n\nThis gas deals 15d6 void damage to creatures in this area as their flesh curdles and rots as well (DC 34 basic Fortitude save save)."
    },
